Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-06-2000||05:48 PM||||Im driving home on the 4th in my Mustang, coming from a party. I stop at a red light and look over, what do I see?? Its a new Huyndi Accent reving his poor engine at about 30,000grand. His buddy looked at me and shook his head (as if they they a snowballs chance in hell in beating me). Well the light turned green and I let them just go.(He was tearing up that little trans) We get to the next light and his buddy opened the window and offered to race me for $10. I couldnt belive it. I told him that he wasnt worth racing. He said how about $20? I said sure (Why not take the dumb little kids money?)Well there was no cars on the road so we waited for the light to turn red again and then we staged them up.Then WOW the guy had a small hose sticking out of the grill. (It was NOS) He purged it and I started cracking up.The light turned green and I kicked his a$$. It was just over a 1/4 mile when I looked back, he was over 1/2 a block behind me. I pulled over into a gas station and he followed me in. He said "I thought I would be faster than a Mustang because I have spary" I guess not. He gave me $15. Thats all he had. It must be nice to have mommy & daddy buy you a new car + stuff to mod it up.  (They were about 16 or 17 years old)     <P>------------------<BR>Carl (85 Fiero) My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>Haze Mustang Performance</A>   &  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A>||||reg||1
